# Tax Agents Registration
The Tax Agents Registration Committee (TARC) hereby notifies all eligible persons (individuals, partnerships, and companies) to submit their applications for registration or renewal of registration as Tax Agents for the period 1 st January 2026 to 31 st December 2026.
Please note that, TARC is mandated under the Tax Procedures Code Act to register, renew, and cancel the registration of non-eligible Tax Agents.
How to apply:
Go to the URA web portal at https://ura.go.ug and follow the steps below:
Log into your TIN Account;
Under e-registration, select Tax Agent registration if you are a new applicant and if you are renewing your registration select renewal of Tax Agent registration;
Click next, fill out the application form, and submit;
Print the submitted form, e-acknowledgement receipt, and Payment Registration Slip;
Pay application fees;
Sign the printed application form and submit it together with a copy of proof of payment of application fees and a Transactional Tax Clearance Certificate to the nearest Domestic Taxes Office;
Note: Every new applicant must attach copies of academic certificates or proof of work experience.
Please note that URA shall only deal with registered and appointed tax agents to handle domestic tax matters on behalf of taxpayers.
For any assistance kindly visit the nearest URA Domestic Taxes Office or call 0800117000/0800217000 (toll-free line) or 0417444602 (not toll-free) or email us at services@ura.go.ug or TARC-secretariat@ura.go.ug
First date of publication: Monday December 08, 2025
CHAIRPERSON TAX AGENTS REGISTRATION COMMITTEE
